    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640160/extras/4f7593cbfb26199a0ee3b626549871eb.avif?t=1755199971\" data-has-big width=800 height=127 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i><u>Groove to Unique Charts</u></i></strong><i>   </i> <br><i>Draw magic powers from <strong>juicy songs</strong> to cast <strong>satisfying combinations</strong> in VR.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640160/extras/7fa2bdebbccbf061fa5a071f39a3bb9d.poster.avif?t=1755199971\" width=435 height=345 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640160/extras/7fa2bdebbccbf061fa5a071f39a3bb9d.webm?t=1755199971\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><u><strong>Learn New Spells</strong></u></i> <br><i>Master the strength of <strong>multiple elements</strong>\u00a0and <strong>level up</strong> to defeat your opponents.</i>   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640160/extras/5922657fe7084b5b7fcf9c739d2e7409.poster.avif?t=1755199971\" width=435 height=345 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640160/extras/5922657fe7084b5b7fcf9c739d2e7409.webm?t=1755199971\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i><strong>Protect Yourself</strong></i></u><br><i>Be prepared to <strong>deflect</strong> and <strong>dodge</strong> as the dark forces strike back.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640160/extras/8e763e7b52b6dab0e4f2463a38503751.poster.avif?t=1755199971\" width=435 height=345 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640160/extras/8e763e7b52b6dab0e4f2463a38503751.webm?t=1755199971\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i><strong>Pull Off Trickshots</strong></i></u>    <br><i>Channel\u00a0<strong>mana</strong> and <strong>spin</strong> your way into the wizard leaderboards.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640160/extras/e6a60ec4e2e875d3f5046c92e51c805a.poster.avif?t=1755199971\" width=435 height=345 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640160/extras/e6a60ec4e2e875d3f5046c92e51c805a.webm?t=1755199971\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i><u>Execute Epic Combos</u></i></strong>     <br><i>Chain <strong>devastating spell sequences</strong> for maximum blast and sick highlights.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640160/extras/4adb70acda5e90908aa25f92f29575c0.poster.avif?t=1755199971\" width=435 height=345 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640160/extras/4adb70acda5e90908aa25f92f29575c0.webm?t=1755199971\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i><strong>Awaken the Wizard in You</strong></i></u><br><i>Feel the joy of <strong>magic wands</strong> in your hands and see you here in Melodica!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640160/extras/8c0767ad4a9c69e2c9c777040b56472a.poster.avif?t=1755199971\" width=435 height=345 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640160/extras/8c0767ad4a9c69e2c9c777040b56472a.webm?t=1755199971\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><strong>Melodica</strong>\u00a0- a fantasy world where <strong>music</strong> is the<strong> source of all magic</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>*</i></strong><i>Coming to SteamVR and Meta Quest*</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_strike\">WHAT?! YOU WERE NOT SUPPOSED TO FIND THIS!!!</span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_strike\">This information is for Elite Wizards only...</span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><span class=\"bb_strike\">There is a <u>secret wizard password</u> hidden somewhere on the Spell Beat website. Pshhh</span></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i></i><br><br><i></i></p>",
